cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use velocity-fl, please cite it as below.
title: "velocity-fl: a Rust core for federated learning aggregation and attack simulation"
abstract: >-
  A federated learning library whose aggregation strategies and attack
  simulation run in a Rust core, exposed through a Python API that works with
  Hugging Face, PEFT and PyTorch models.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Arnaldo
    family-names: Barea
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-7938-2376"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ajbarea/velocity-fl"
url: "https://ajbarea.github.io/velocity-fl/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - byzantine robustness
  - rust
  - pytorch
  - parameter-efficient fine-tuning
